{"repositoryId":1111875852,"availability":"available","full":"europanite/client-side-speech-ai","name":"client-side-speech-ai","description":"Browser-Based Client-Side Speech AI Powered by Whisper and Kokoro.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":6,"forks":0,"created":"2025-12-07T19:49:53Z","updated":"2026-10-16T04:42:13Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://europanite.github.io/client-side-speech-ai/","topics":["ai-on-browser","audio","audio-transcription","client-side-ai","huggingface","huggingface-transformers","kokoro","kokoro-tts","real-time-transcription","speech-recognition","speech-to-text","stt","stt-tts","text-to-speech","text-to-speeh","transcription","transformer","tts","typescript","whisper"],"demo":"https://europanite.github.io/client-side-speech-ai/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T15:51:50.651Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T15:51:50.651Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T15:51:50.651Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T15:51:50.651Z","stars":6,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["🇺🇸 English | 🇮🇳 हिंदी | 🇯🇵 日本語 | 🇨🇳 简体中文 | 🇪🇸 Español | 🇧🇷 Português (Brasil) | 🇰🇷 한국어 | 🇩🇪 Deutsch | 🇫🇷 Français","This project is a bidirectional audio/text web app built with React, TypeScript, and Vite. Whisper runs locally through @huggingface/transformers for STT. Kokoro-82M with the kokoro-js-jp browser runtime supports English and Japanese TTS, including local WAV generation, playback, and download.","The interface has two modes but one shared workspace: Audio on the left, Text on the right. STT supports media files and live microphone capture; TTS lets you edit text and generate playable and downloadable speech. Mobile layouts stack the Audio and Text panes."],"features":["Client-side speech-to-text","The React app calls the automatic-speech-recognition pipeline from @huggingface/transformers directly in the browser, so transcription runs entirely on the client.","Client-side neural text-to-speech","Kokoro generates speech for English or Japanese, with WAV playback and file download. The model runs locally after assets have been downloaded; synthesis is batch-based.","Unified STT/TTS workspace"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/europanite/client-side-speech-ai/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a4b6d8a26cabb9f51d75d6d734fd0533ad30b1cbbf95f316c81b42572ea725be","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T15:51:50.800Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T15:51:50.800Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"🇺🇸 English | 🇮🇳 हिंदी | 🇯🇵 日本語 | 🇨🇳 简体中文 | 🇪🇸 Español | 🇧🇷 Português (Brasil) | 🇰🇷 한국어 | 🇩🇪 Deutsch | 🇫🇷 Français","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/europanite/client-side-speech-ai/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"a4b6d8a26cabb9f51d75d6d734fd0533ad30b1cbbf95f316c81b42572ea725be","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/europanite/client-side-speech-ai/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T15:51:50.801Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-16T04:42:13Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/europanite/client-side-speech-ai/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T15:51:50.802Z","hash":"a4b6d8a26cabb9f51d75d6d734fd0533ad30b1cbbf95f316c81b42572ea725be","originalBytes":9893,"storedBytes":9893,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T15:51:50.651Z","subjects":["Image, audio & video AI","Music & audio"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"AI & machine learning","subjects":["Image, audio & video AI","Music & audio"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Image, audio & video AI","source":"metadata","match":"tts"},{"subject":"Music & audio","source":"metadata","match":"audio transcription"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Mobile","Streaming"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://europanite.github.io/client-side-speech-ai/","atte